// A tied rank names the earliest concept and still posts. Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE tie  ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE one  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG tie one

IMPULSE tie 1
IMPULSE one 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY one
DECIDE one
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "ties" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
